# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for kmx-aio.
#
# Read automatically by script/feature/common.sh whenever a TSan build runs.
#
# TSan reports races that are real by its model but deliberate by design - a benign flag read outside a
# lock, or a third-party library with its own synchronisation that TSan cannot see. Those are what this
# file is for; a race in this library's own code is a bug, and suppressing it hides it.
#
# The syntax names the report type and a function or library substring, for example:
#
#     race:liburing
#     called_from_lib:libvsomeip3.so
#
# No suppressions are active: every race the current test suite reports is one to look at.
